---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Shopping Gems" description="Shopping Gems privacy policy: what data we collect, how cookies and affiliate links work, your rights, and how to contact us. Last updated September 2026.">
  <p class="my-[18px] text-[13px] text-slate-500"><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand">Home</a> / <span class="text-slate-700">Privacy Policy</span></p>

  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-slate-500">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Your privacy, in plain English</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: September 15, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
    <h2 class="text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest">On this page</h2>
    <ul class="mt-2 grid gap-1.5 text-[15px] font-semibold sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li><a href="#collect" class="hover:text-brand">1. Information we collect</a></li>
      <li><a href="#cookies" class="hover:text-brand">2. Cookies</a></li>
      <li><a href="#affiliates" class="hover:text-brand">3. Affiliate links</a></li>
      <li><a href="#use" class="hover:text-brand">4. How we use information</a></li>
      <li><a href="#sharing" class="hover:text-brand">5. Data sharing</a></li>
      <li><a href="#rights" class="hover:text-brand">6. Your rights</a></li>
      <li><a href="#children" class="hover:text-brand">7. Children</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" class="hover:text-brand">8. Contact us</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="prose-sg mt-6 max-w-3xl pb-4">
    <h2 id="collect">1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Information you give us:</strong> your name and email when you use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> or newsletter signup. <strong>Automatic information:</strong> basic, anonymized visit statistics (pages viewed, device type) via privacy-friendly analytics. We do not run accounts, comments, or checkouts, so we never handle passwords or payment details.</p>
    <h2 id="cookies">2. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a minimal set of cookies: strictly necessary ones for the site to function, and affiliate cookies set by retailers (e.g. Amazon, AliExpress) when you click an outbound deal link so they can credit the referral. You can block cookies in your browser settings; the site keeps working.</p>
    <h2 id="affiliates">3. Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some outbound links are affiliate links. If you buy through them, the retailer may pay us a small commission at no extra cost to you. This is how Shopping Gems stays free, and it never influences which deals we feature or how we rank them.</p>
    <h2 id="use">4. How we use information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your messages and fix reported errors.</li>
      <li>To send the newsletter you explicitly signed up for (unsubscribe anytime).</li>
      <li>To understand which guides help readers, using aggregated statistics only.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id="sharing">5. Data sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell personal data. Ever. Information is shared only with the infrastructure needed to run the site (hosting, email delivery) or when required by law.</p>
    <h2 id="rights">6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Request a copy, correction, or deletion of your personal data at any time via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> — we action requests within 30 days. Newsletter emails always include a one-click unsubscribe link.</p>
    <h2 id="children">7. Children</h2>
    <p>Shopping Gems is a general-audience shopping blog and does not knowingly collect data from children under 13. Parents may request deletion via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="changes">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We update this page when our practices change; the "Last updated" date above always reflects the current version. Material changes will be highlighted here for 30 days.</p>
    <h2 id="contact">8. Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy? Reach us through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> with the topic "Privacy" and we'll respond within 2 business days.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
